<name><surname>Laquerri&#x000e8;re</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vital</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Dumanchin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Feuillette</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Brice</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vercelletto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>APP locus duplication causes autosomal dominant early-onset alzheimer disease with cerebral amyloid angiopathy</article-title><source>Nat. Genet.</source><year>2006</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>24</fpage><lpage>26</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16369530</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fellermann</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Stange</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaeffeler</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmalzl</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wehkamp</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bevins</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Reinisch</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Teml</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwab</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lichter</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A chromosome 8 gene-cluster polymorphism with low human beta-defensin 2 gene copy number predisposes to Crohn disease of the colon</article-title><source>Am. J. Hum. Genet.</source><year>2006</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>439</fpage><lpage>448</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16909382</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-t